citation></ref></ref-list></back><floats-group><fig id="f1-co-2-649" position="float"><label>Figure 1</label><caption><p>Spontaneous nonhealing conjunctival defect.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="co-2-649f1"/></fig><fig id="f2-co-2-649" position="float"><label>Figure 2</label><caption><p>Large persistent conjunctival defect post corneal gluing.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="co-2-649f2"/></fig></floats-group></article>